    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d302-a1">

                <pb facs="0423" n="349" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg349"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Covarrubias to Mr. Nelson.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of Foreign Relations,
                                Santiago de Chili,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santiago,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-10-29"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 29, 1865</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to transmit to your
                    excellency two copies of the counter-manifesto which, by order of his Excellency
                    the President of the republic, I have the honor to address to friendly nations,
                    to show to them the true causes and antecedents of the present war between Chili
                    and Spain.</p>
                <p>I dare to hope that your excellency will be pleased to transmit one of the
                    accompanying copies to your government.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this opportunity to offer to your excellency the reiterated
                    expression of my distinguished consideration, with which I am your excellency’s
                    most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ALVARO COVARRUBIAS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Envoy Extraordinary and Minister
                            Plenipotentiary</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">of the United States of North America</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
